msgid ""
"UTF-8 .txt file, as Tesseract writes it: a form feed between pages. It must "
"have as many pages as the scan."
msgstr ""
"Plik .txt w UTF-8, taki jak zapisuje go Tesseract: strony rozdzielone "
"znakiem nowej strony (form feed). Musi mieć tyle stron co skan."

msgid ""
"Upload the scan and the OCR file together, so their pages can be compared."
msgstr "Wgraj skan i plik OCR razem, żeby dało się porównać ich strony."

